# Force LF line endings regardless of a contributor's local core.autocrlf.
# files/entrypoint.sh and files/setup.exp get COPY'd straight into the
# Linux image and run via their #!/bin/bash / #!/usr/bin/expect shebang;
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites them to
# CRLF, which breaks the shebang line and fails as a confusing
# "exec /entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory" with no other clue —
# discovered while build-testing this repo on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
